@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Register a project (use a real folder, e.g. this repo itself)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ContextLayer",
  "rootPath": "C:/Users/Asus/Desktop/ContextLayer",
  "description": "Indexing ourselves"
}

### List
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1

### Validation error demo (blank name)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "rootPath": "C:/x" }

### Index a project
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/index

### Stats
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/stats

### Git: sync history
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/sync

### Git: hot files / commits / co-change / uncommitted work
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/hot-files
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/recent-commits
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/co-changes?path=backend/pom.xml
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/working-changes